    {
      "name": "口述声纹与既有蓝灰底",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "speech-waveform",
      "description": "SpeechWaveform.java:26–59；DictationSurface.java:110–144。20 根静音基线柱，位于父容器 33%/13%，占 34%/10%；背景半径为 max(width,height)×0.65。样本只示底材与测量器，不构造语音手势新布局。3px 柱宽对应手机宽度；窄容器继续由 CSS min 限制，原生以 Canvas 公式为准。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-speech\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"口述声纹静音基线，非实时录音\"><div class=\"ds-speech-backdrop\"></div><svg class=\"ds-speech-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"ds-speech-gradient\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#14beca\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#4c80ff\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"2.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"7.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"12.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"17.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"22.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"27.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"32.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"37.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"42.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"47.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"52.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"57.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"62.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"67.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"72.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"77.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"82.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"87.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"92.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/><rect class=\"ds-speech-bar\" x=\"97.5%\" y=\"50%\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1.5\" transform=\"translate(-1.5,-2)\" fill=\"url(#ds-speech-gradient)\"/></svg></div>",
      "css": ".ds-speech{position:relative;container-type:size;isolation:isolate;width:100%;height:286px;overflow:hidden;background:#222222;}.ds-speech-backdrop{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle max(65cqw,65cqh) at 50% 60%,#2a3843 0%,#222222 100%);}.ds-speech-meter{position:absolute;left:33%;top:13%;width:34%;height:10%;}.ds-speech-bar{width:min(3px,2.5%);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "录音笔声纹",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "recording-waveform",
      "description": "RecordingPanel.java:79–80；RecordingWaveform.java:11,18–37。64×36dp，13 个真实音量样本、2dp 圆头线；这里 value=0，半高 1dp，不用循环动画伪造说话。",
      "html": "<svg class=\"ds-recording-waveform\" width=\"64\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 36\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"录音笔声纹静音基线，非实时录音\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"ds-recording-gradient\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#14beca\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#4c80ff\"/></linearGradient></defs><g stroke=\"url(#ds-recording-gradient)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"6.4\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"6.4\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"10.666666666666666\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"10.666666666666666\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"14.933333333333334\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"14.933333333333334\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"19.2\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"19.2\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"23.466666666666665\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"23.466666666666665\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"27.733333333333334\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"27.733333333333334\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"32\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"32\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"36.266666666666666\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"36.266666666666666\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"40.53333333333333\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"40.53333333333333\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"44.8\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"44.8\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"49.06666666666667\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"49.06666666666667\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"53.333333333333336\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"53.333333333333336\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"57.6\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"57.6\" y2=\"19\"/></g></svg>",
      "css": ".ds-recording-waveform{display:block;width:64px;height:36px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "熟悉的灰阶键盘，克制的声音点色",
    "overview": "深灰底、逐级提亮的石墨面、正文白与暖白动作构成共同语言。豆包输入法的熟悉键位与语音手势是已确认的参照；品牌通过精确的布局、清楚的动作和声音反馈出现。App 的浅蓝只标记练习入口、选项与个人资料中的重点；键盘保持上一版灰阶。\n\n青到蓝的线性渐变用于真实声纹；口述面板保留既有蓝灰径向底色。两者分别是声音读数和原有底材，不把声纹配色扩展成通用按钮或卡片渐变。字体服从 Android 系统的 `sans` 与字号设置，卡片主要靠面色、间隔与圆角分层。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "灰阶键盘与暖白主动作，保留既有蓝灰语音底色。",
      "App 浅蓝点缀与六格表达身份色，各自限定用途。",
      "系统 sans、原生涟漪、圆角容器和按实际组件取值的密度。",
      "内容与明确动作优先，只记录已实现的组件。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Grayscale Keyboard Rule",
        "body": "普通键盘与键盘内的录音、帮我回动作保持灰阶；既有蓝灰语音底色和真实声纹是已授权的局部例外。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Scoped Accent Rule",
        "body": "App 浅蓝、表达身份色与声纹端点按上述用途使用；不从局部颜色推导全屏品牌底色或新增渐变组件。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Native Metrics Rule",
        "body": "普通文字保持 sp 与主题 sans，显式粗体仅记录代码中的 BOLD；不把 Canvas 的 dp 文字或未设置的默认值编成字体规范。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Measured Gutter Rule",
        "body": "共用布局优先复用源码中的间隔；方向契约的 8dp 沟槽不是所有容器的实测统一值，帮我回 sheet 的 6dp inset 作为差异保留。",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tonal Surface Rule",
        "body": "卡片依靠已实现的面色与间隔分层；键盘只保留源码明确设置的原生轻 elevation，不推广新的阴影配方。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 沿用灰阶键盘、既有蓝灰口述底色与青蓝真实声纹。",
      "**Do** 将 App 浅蓝、槽位身份色、品牌图形底色按各自已实现的用途使用。",
      "**Do** 从 frontmatter 取实际 dp/sp 值，按组件区分 padding、圆角、视觉尺寸与点击布局。",
      "**Do** 保持系统 sans 与原生 inset、涟漪和可访问性标签；以源码与 manifest 中的原生截图复核外观。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 新增尚未实现的键盘模式、控件变体、字体、色阶、统一间距基数或网页断点。",
      "**Don't** 将声纹渐变用于普通键盘按钮、卡片或新的全屏品牌底色。",
      "**Don't** 把字符箭头、eyebrow helper、局部硬编码、dp Canvas 文字或较小点击布局立为未来界面的惯例。",
      "**Don't** 用视觉 token 文档、UI fixture 或 sidecar 浏览器样本宣称 F1 模型语义、真实学习或真机体验已验收。",
      ""
    ]
  }
}
